'''Baby Mola''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] (JP) and [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]] (Global) significantly improves recharge time. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]].

