==Trivia==
*As opposed to Mola King, Baby Mola doesn't skip any step in its evolution and instead follows the same pattern as in the game (In ''Survive! Mola Mola, Baby Mola evolves into Young Man Mola but Mola King doesn't evolve into Living Legend)''
*Despite being called Baby Mola, it resembles the Kid Mola far more than the Baby Mola.
*Its low HP is a clear reference to how easy sunfish die (which is also a running gag and main story driver of ''Survive! Mola Mola'' where the main objective is to avoid killing the sunfish).
*Common mola is another way of saying sunfish, and "mola mola" is the scientific name.

